[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":111},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-2026-mo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship-at-birmingham-university-how-to-apply-175":3},{"news":4,"more":28},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":27},175,"2026-mo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship-at-birmingham-university-how-to-apply-175","2026 Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship At Birmingham University: How To Apply","\u003Cp>The Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at the University of Birmingham presents a remarkable opportunity for African students to pursue a two-year program aimed at enhancing their leadership skills and contributing to the development of the African continent.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>This scholarship, fully funded by the Mo Ibrahim Foundation, offers comprehensive support to successful candidates, including tuition fees, living allowances, airfare, and internship opportunities.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Mo Ibrahim Foundation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Location: United Kingdom\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fstudy-abroad\u002Fstudy-in-uk\u002F\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> ||  \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fcategory\u002Fscholarships-and-opportunities\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>£18,000 Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Travel Costs\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: African Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: April 24, 2026\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>About Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham University aims to foster a new generation of African leaders through a rigorous academic curriculum combined with practical internship experience.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham covers the full tuition fee, provides a generous stipend, and offers support for airfare and visa expenses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Additionally, recipients benefit from a six-month internship opportunity with the Mo Ibrahim Foundation in London, allowing them to contribute to the Foundation’s initiatives.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Benefits of Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at the University of Birmingham offers the following benefits:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full tuition fee coverage.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Airfare to and from the United Kingdom, as well as visa expenses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Monthly stipend of £950 for 18 months.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Arrival allowance of £950.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Six-month internship funded directly by the Mo Ibrahim Foundation.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Available Programmes for Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>For the 2026\u002F27 academic session, the Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham will accept applications to the MSc in Development Policy and Politics programmes\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham , applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Hold a first-class Honours degree or equivalent from an approved university.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be under 30 years of age at the time of application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Demonstrate proficiency in written and spoken English (IELTS: at least level 6.5 or TOEFL: 580\u002F93).\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be African nationals domiciled in an African country, preferably in Sub-Saharan Africa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Required Documents for Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>While applying for the 2026 Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham , you will be required to submit the following documents;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Complete Application Form\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Academic Transcripts\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Bachelors\u002F Diploma Certificate \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Personal Statement\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Recommendation Letters\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Proof of English Language Proficiency \u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>In addition to standard application documents, applicants must submit a 500-word statement and CV outlining why they are the best candidate for the scholarship.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To apply for the Mo Ibrahim Foundation Scholarship at Birmingham, follow the procedures below;\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visit the application page through the provided link.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Apply through the University’s online application system by the deadline.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Email your application ID number to \u003Ca href=\"mailto:d.l.beard@bham.ac.uk\">\u003Cstrong>Debra Beard\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fa> with the subject line “Mo Ibrahim Scholarship.”\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fmo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship-at-birmingham\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fmo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship-at-birmingham\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-23 11:01:42",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-mo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship-at-birmingham-university-how-to-apply\u002F69e9ee06e9c565.97781856_screenshot 2026-04-23 105524.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002F2026-mo-ibrahim-foundation-scholarship-at-birmingham-university-how-to-apply\u002F69e9ee06e9c565.97781856_screenshot%202026-04-23%20105524.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",3,[29,39,49,58,67,76,85,94,102],{"id":30,"slug":31,"title":32,"images":33,"datePosted":37,"authorName":38},305,"da